{"binary":"D3DConf_12_Video.dll","group":"Conf_VideoNative","reason":"Kills the VM about 76 min in, as it does on the D3DMetal backend (d3dmetal.jsonl, through a QEMU hvf assert there).  Here DXMT has no D3D12, so every case's TestSetup crashes the TAEF host (0xC0000005) and is Blocked; after 2,001 such relaunches, each creating a Neptune device, the guest rebooted with no bugcheck event, taking the runner with it.  Nothing in the group can pass on this backend, so excluding it loses no verdict.","evidence":"D3DConf_12_Video in the Neptune DXMT full sweep of 2026-10-23: the guest's partial output ends at Conf_VideoNative case 2,001 [Blocked], last written 02:32:51, and the guest rebooted at 02:34"}
